cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "disturbtorque: environmental disturbance torques for spacecraft attitude sizing"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OPTIMA Organisation"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-31"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/OmAcharya-avtr/disturbtorque"
abstract: >-
  Gravity-gradient, aerodynamic, solar-radiation-pressure and residual-magnetic-dipole
  torque models for spacecraft attitude sizing, each stated with its source, units,
  assumptions and validity range, swept over a circular orbit and split into secular and
  cyclic components with the angular momentum that follows from integrating them.
  Research-grade; not flight-qualified.
keywords:
  - spacecraft
  - attitude control
  - disturbance torque
  - momentum management
